# Vendored third-party C. qio does not write or test these lines, and they
# outnumber the package's own by roughly fifty to one, so counting them makes
# the coverage figure a measure of how much carquet, zstd and LZ4 happen to be
# exercised rather than of how well qio is tested. Package-owned C under
# src/qio*.c is deliberately not excluded.
src/carquet
src/zstd
src/lz4
